description.text:
One single piercing attack at True Cap Break Level 1, grants [Instant ATB 1] & [Instant Cast 1] to user;
During Tactical Awoken Mode, Cap Break Level 2 & ATB Speed x1.2 to Wind/Lightning Abilities, and Weapon Skill Blue/Gold with at least Lv.0/2 En-Wind/Lightning;
WS Blue: [Lv.2 En-Wind/Lightning to user]
WS Gold: [Instant Magic 3 & Sorcery Damage +30% for 3 turns to party]

